      <h1>Top 10 Leather Jacket Manufacturer Profiles in China: A Buyer's Evaluation Guide (2026)</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-15">October 15, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/top-10-leather-jacket-manufacturers-china/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">China's apparel export base is large enough that leather outerwear supports its own supply chain at every price tier. For a buyer, that scale matters far less than what sits underneath it: thousands of factories, capability levels that swing from workshop to industrial park, and a matching problem no ranking can solve on its own</p>
